{"type":"text","timestamp":1785684653028,"sessionID":"ses_03ce74987ffe7MZlcIs7tveex2","part":{"id":"prt_fc3196b760011jZTZL4tjnhz1Q","messageID":"msg_fc31963f7001jTA5twALF6drrM","sessionID":"ses_03ce74987ffe7MZlcIs7tveex2","type":"text","text":"**2009/2010 赛季中，主队场均进球高于客队场均进球的联赛（共 11 个）：**\n\n- Belgium Jupiler League\n- England Premier League\n- France Ligue 1\n- Germany 1. Bundesliga\n- Italy Serie A\n- Netherlands Eredivisie\n- Poland Ekstraklasa\n- Portugal Liga ZON Sagres\n- Scotland Premier League\n- Spain LIGA BBVA\n- Switzerland Super League\n\n计算口径：`AVG(xx_goal) = SUM(xx_goal) / COUNT(DISTINCT Match.id)`，按 `season='2009/2010'` 过滤，依据 `european_football_2` 库 `Match` 与 `League` 表（通过 `get_entity_mapping` 获取的 database_url）。\n\nFinal Answer: Belgium Jupiler League, England Premier League, France Ligue 1, Germany 1. Bundesliga, Italy Serie A, Netherlands Eredivisie, Poland Ekstraklasa, Portugal Liga ZON Sagres, Scotland Premier League, Spain LIGA BBVA, Switzerland Super League\nEvidence SQL: SELECT l.name AS league_name FROM Match m JOIN League l ON m.league_id = l.id WHERE m.season = '2009/2010' GROUP BY l.id, l.name HAVING CAST(SUM(m.home_team_goal) AS REAL) / COUNT(DISTINCT m.id) > CAST(SUM(m.away_team_goal) AS REAL) / COUNT(DISTINCT m.id)","time":{"start":1785684650870,"end":1785684653017}}}
